<!-- agent-scaffold:workspace-rules -->
## Rules for every service

- Create new services with `agent-scaffold add-service <folder>`, never by hand, so each one gets the standard structure for its role.
- Services talk only through their documented interfaces: no importing another service's code, no reading its database.
- Change a contract in a backward-compatible way, or update every consumer in the same piece of work.
- For a change that spans services, plan across all of them first, change the contract first, then roll out in an order where nothing breaks in between.
<!-- /agent-scaffold:workspace-rules -->

